  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/545/title.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"399\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p><p><strong>本模組新增礦物並利用未使用的元素來創造多樣化內容。這是我最初幾個模組的重製版，希望你們會喜歡。此模組使用 Mcreator 工具製作。</strong></p><p><strong>如同多數模組，本作新增了礦石，這些礦物讓和平模式的玩家也能取得特定資源，同時新增可製作新物品的礦物。此外還加入了 6 種怪物與 2 個新生態域。</strong></p><p><strong>建議安裝 JEI 以查詢物品合成方式</strong></p><p>我是法國人，此模組使用 Mcreator 製作（英文若有錯誤請見諒 😅）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以下是模組新增的盔甲，各自擁有特殊能力，部分可免疫特定藥水效果，遊戲中會顯示在盔甲下方說明。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/546/image1.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"480\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre>主世界生成的礦石（骨礦、終界珍珠礦、火藥礦、虹彩礦、苦礦、金陶礦、冰晶石英礦）：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/547/image2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"135\"></pre><pre>地獄生成的礦石（地獄煤礦、地獄鐵礦、地獄紅石礦、地獄金礦、地獄綠寶石礦、地獄鑽石礦、毒液礦）：</pre><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/548/image3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"135\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">虹彩礦：1-8層<br>苦礦：1-4層<br>終界礦：1-126層<br>毒液礦：120-126層（0.1.8版修正）</div><p><br>終界生成的礦石（終界礦）：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/549/image4.png\" width=\"122\" height=\"135\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如你所見，模組新增了苦礦、虹彩礦、毒液礦、終界礦等4種獨立礦物，目前可用於製作盔甲與工具</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/551/image5.png\" width=\"647\" height=\"287\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以及3種新附魔：</p><p><strong>挖掘：</strong>與額外工具搭配，可進行3x3範圍採掘</p><p><strong>氣象吸收：</strong>與虹彩盔甲搭配，惡劣天氣時獲得增益效果<br><strong>終界相位：</strong>與終界盔甲搭配，潛行時凍結（免疫擊退）但會對水脆弱</p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre>新增生物：熔岩獒犬（生成於地獄荒原，可用烈焰桿方塊繁殖）、魂地住民（生成於地獄荒原/靈魂砂谷/緋紅森林）、陶巨像（生成於惡地）、溺屍苦力怕（生成於暖洋）、遊蕩之魂（生成於雪原/靈魂砂谷）、沙陷者（生成於沙漠/海灘，可獲取流沙瓶）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/552/image6.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"457\"></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p>新增兩種生態域：石林與詭木林<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/553/image7.png\" width=\"1072\" height=\"816\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模組內含果叢系統：</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/554/image8.png\" width=\"722\" height=\"406\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>弗托斯生物：棲息於特定生態域的中立生物，雖無特殊用途但掉落物豐富！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/555/image9.png\" width=\"1129\" height=\"832\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/556/image10.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1emF_dCRfGw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_2sTKWXyv9Q?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可將本模組加入整合包<br></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">亦可參考我的其他模組：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutated-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/779/64/64/638727280864889757.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1158/714/64/64/638727221391013276.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-</p>\n</div>",
